  "prefLabel": "Mec 702.02 Heating oil",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 702.02 “Heating oil” means any liquid fuel used in any heating equipment system that is designed to use such fuel, whether residential or non-residential, whether hot water or air, and whether a heating system or appliance.\n\nSource. #13631, eff 7-9-23",
